{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor actively queried the workspace and used family-provided records to identify key discharge gaps (ECG abnormality, cardiology consult, suggested echocardiography, missing medication list). He explained the systemic vascular-risk nature of retinal artery occlusion and separated known facts from unconfirmed atrial fibrillation. He gave a concrete follow-up plan with specific owners and materials, obtained family teach-back and role confirmation, and set strict medication/antithrombotic boundaries. No serious responsibility-chain error occurred, and two high-order points (HO1, HO2) were triggered and meaningfully completed with trajectory impact. The minor omission in explicit closure-of-baseline screening (RC1) with only generic red-flag questions initially, later supplemented but not fully closed, constitutes a minor error, capping the grade at 2 borderline.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The final family message confirms a concrete, role-assigned, and safety-bounded plan with teach-back. The plan is executable and the doctor did not close prematurely.",
    "label": "valid_closure",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
        "explanation": "The doctor's initial message asked for specific documents (discharge summary, eye exam reports, medication list) and asked about the patient's functional status and caregiver presence, demonstrating responsibility-chain action for discharge planning.",
        "quote": "请您把出院小结、这次住院期间的眼科检查报告（尤其是眼底血管相关检查）、以及出院带的药单找出来，仔细拍照或扫描上传到我们的对话里。同时也可以告诉我，父亲现在在家里能走动吗，有没有人全天陪着。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00090",
        "explanation": "The doctor explained the medical logic linking retinal artery occlusion to systemic vascular risk and prioritized cardiology/cardiac echo as the source investigation before ophthalmology local follow-up.",
        "quote": "右眼视网膜中央动脉阻塞本身是眼科的急症，它就像眼睛的“小中风”。但这个病的根源常常在心脏和血管上。既然出院记录里心内科已经建议做心脏彩超，而且您还没找到预约或已做的单子，那现在最安全、最不耽误病情的顺序是把“尽快挂心内科并完成心脏彩超”放在第一位"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00060",
        "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly used workspace queries to gather records and referenced the family's prior statements, maintaining continuity across turns.",
        "quote": "我先调取一下这位患者本次住院期间的完整病历，重点看：出院记录（出院小结）、住院期间的病程记录、眼科检查报告（眼底血管造影、OCT等具体结果）、心内科会诊记录原文、出院带药清单。同时查一下他在CareLoop联合医疗网络内是否已有心脏彩超预约或执行的记录"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00090",
        "explanation": "The doctor explicitly warned against self-starting anticoagulants or antiplatelets and required verification of the actual discharge medication list before any change.",
        "quote": "您今晚没给他吃这类药，不是耽误，反而是守住了安全。在心脏彩超没做、病因没明确之前，医生不开出院口服抗栓药，本身就是一种保护——防止在不该抗凝的情况下抗凝引起颅内或眼底出血。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00143",
        "explanation": "The doctor adapted the follow-up plan to the family's real constraints (time-conflicting appointments, role division between siblings) and offered a clear fallback for when only one specialty can be seen first.",
        "quote": "如果两个号时间完全冲突，只能选一个先看：先看心内科。原因很清楚——这个病的源头，就像前面说的，大概率在心脏或大血管。眼科是管理视力恢复和局部视网膜情况的，心内科是查源头、防下一枪打到脑子或另一只眼的。所以先心内，更稳。"
      }
    ]
  },
